      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "どうしたんだご主人？\n……おっ！　ハーピーの卵か！\nうまそうだなー、それ、どうやって食べるんだ？",
      "jp_sha256": "f1f0209fbddc642dad7b9c6df426b767a0a90739e15bc25e4e4924b49983ebb4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "무슨 일이야, 주인님?\n……오! 하피 알이잖아!\n맛있겠는데, 그거 어떻게 먹을 거야?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
